{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/23890a2ee776abb92029e54884e9c3a57fa138e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\log_8 225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/3/e931f9ff78e448dc3fac3f7652528c696934b6c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\log_2 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc9de9754f38d754560c9ae9a7d3fa2c19deff0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ b/2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2b/3 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ b \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3b/2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"426\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the change-of-base rule: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/5/e7527ea0a5dc55ecc39591d715ce72f786ec9075.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{\\log 225}{\\log 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"90\" height=\"41\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/6/fb6cf7420e837a572a0af86c2de75fcc244e7142.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{\\log 15}{\\log 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"79\" height=\"41\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/e/dbef6cd33905fb2580c97a4b4287dcc3bc1edb66.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{b} = \\frac{\\log 225 \\log 2}{\\log 8 \\log 15}\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/c/88c43a50ec24325a896749b7ef1716b4ad14b0b6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = b \\cdot \\frac{\\log 225}{\\log 15} \\cdot \\frac{\\log 2}{\\log 8}\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/0/ef0ec26bd9555b37bbf1815b0e6b5f479ee1cd0b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = b \\log_{15} 225 \\log_8 2\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/e/a4e8bfc8cefcdc574fe5329a5f1868d1ff1980b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = \\boxed{\\frac{2b}3 \\textbf{ (B)}}\\]\" width=\"100\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME\" title=\"1962 AHSME\">1962 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a 